## 10. Agent-Reach Round (2026-09-10) — Phase 150

Protocol: user-directed repo analysis → gap comparison vs .sdd/ → Pareto
decide → integrate patterns → delete clone. Clone: tmp/agent-reach/ (deleted;
decisions preserved below + in artifact citations).

Repo: https://github.com/Panniantong/Agent-Reach (MIT, v1.5.0, Python 3.10+)
What it is: capability LAYER (not a tool) — internet reading for agents;
15 platforms; ordered backend routing; doctor health-check with real
probing; credential-local discipline; SKILL.md agent interface.

Gap findings (4 adopted groups out of 12 analyzed — see DECISIONS):
| # | Agent-Reach pro | .sdd-də çatışmazlıq | İnteqrasiya |
|---|----------------|---------------------|-------------|
| G1 | Ordered backend routing (primary→fallback list; switch=reorder; user override; stale-override ignored) | fallback anlayışı var, ordered list + override safety yoxdur | runtime/integration-routing.sdd [IR-01..04] |
| G2-G4 | Doctor + real probe (missing/broken/timeout/error 4-way; venv-shim detection; transient-only retries; per-channel degrade) | /sdd-health yalnız daxili integrity yoxlayırdı | sdd-health [HEALTH-05..07] + [IR-05..08] |
| G6-G7 | Credential boundaries (local-only 600, no-login-for-user, no cookie reads, env-only injection, URL-cred scrub) | xarici kanal credential qaydaları yox idi | security-rules.sdd cat.6 [SEC-09..13] |
| G8 | Announce-before-use + active backend transparency | xarici fetch üçün yox idi | research arm [RS1-11] |

Kinship (validated, no change needed): capability-layer philosophy —
"select/install/health-check/route, no wrapper" = SDDRA spec-first [IR-10].

NOT imported (deliberate): Python channel code (spec-first — patterns
only), 15 channels as .sdd components (user-machine capability, out of
SDDRA core scope), SKILL.md verbatim (referenced [SR11] + marketplace
entry instead). Any future CLI use is Docker-gated [R59-R66].

